OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Aattempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after two men were
OL,8,Fseriously injured at Brighton Marina,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to a disturbance
OL,12,Fon Marina Way outside Hollywood Bowl at
OL,13,Fabout 22:30 GMT on Friday.
OL,15,FThe two injured men, aged 22 and 30,
OL,16,Fwere struck by a vehicle, believed to
OL,17,Fbe a black Range Rover, and the driver
OL,18,Fleft the scene, said Sussex Police..
