OL,5,
OL,6,FA 45-year-old man was later arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder, causing
OL,8,Fgrievous bodily harm and possession of
OL,9,Fcocaine, the force confirmed. He
OL,10,Fremains in custody.
